{"page_content": "7\n\n.6 Hazardous waste incineration187\n\nHALS-1 is not contained in any hazardous wastes from consumer mixtures. It may be contained in wastes from risk management measures (e.g. air filters), in contaminated packages and in off-specification batches at all stages of the supply chain. The relevant types of wastes and treatment scenarios are indicated in Table R.18- 88.\n\nTable R.18- 88: Correlation of PCs and waste treatment processes", "metadata": {"doc_id": "8950db83-995e-41f4-96ba-6b0fab83fd9c", "content_type": "CompositeElement", "filename": "r18_v2_final_en.pdf"}}